			"date": "2023-08-28T16:10:11.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@bastianallgeier\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>bastianallgeier</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> is that what they call becoming a \"lifestyle company\"?</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110968122660202353",
			"parentId": "110968065525440217",
			"url": "https://cosocial.ca/@boris/110968122588329508",
			"author": {
				"name": "Boris Mann",
				"url": "https://cosocial.ca/@boris",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/110/118/955/928/962/297/original/35ae22c59e006661.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2023-08-28T16:12:55.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> yes the attendant dedicated entity with funding makes it muddier. For GPL (for instance), having an entity hold all the copyrights gives only it the ability to re-license. </p><p>Now that we know they won’t pursue hosting, what larger codebase features and thus services might they offer.</p><p>Potentially parallels Gatsby -&gt; Gatsby Cloud entanglement. </p><p>Something something “maintainer deficit”</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110968130201144246",
			"parentId": "110968122660202353",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/110968130201144246",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
